":"<section><h2>Are we on pace today?</h2><div class=\"sub\">Orders so far today against a normal day at the same hour &middot; Pacific</div><div class=\"metrics\"><div class=\"metric hero\"><div class=\"k\">Orders so far</div><div class=\"v\">6</div><span class=\"delta down\">\u25bc 33%</span> vs 9.0 by this hour</div><div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"k\">On track to finish</div><div class=\"v\">7</div>about $851</div><div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"k\">A normal full day</div><div class=\"v\">10.1</div>$1,544 in revenue</div></div><div class=\"chartwrap short\"><canvas id=\"pace_chart\"></canvas></div><p class=\"note\">The red line is today and it stops at the current hour. The dashed line is where a normal day sits at each hour, averaged over the 25 previous days we have. Right now we are <b>behind</b> that pace. The finishing figure assumes the rest of today follows the same shape as those days, which off 25 days of history is a rough guide, not a forecast.</p></section>","pace":{"labels":["12a","1a","2a","3a","4a","5a","6a","7a","8a","9a","10a","11a","12p","1p","2p","3p","4p","5p","6p","7p","8p","9p","10p","11p"],"today":[0,0,0,0,0,2,2,2,2,2,2,3,3,4,5,5,6,6,6,6],"avg":[0.12,0.2,0.24,0.4,0.6,0.84,1.2,1.8,2.2,3.12,3.76,4.56,5.44,6.16,7.04,7.64,8.04,8.36,8.56,9.0,9.4,9.84,10.0,10.08],"now_h":19},"traffic_html":"<section><h2>Is traffic normal today?</h2><div class=\"sub\">Visits from Google so far today, 2026-09-17, counted up to 18:59 Eastern and compared with the same hours on the last 4 Thursdays</div><div class=\"ttv\"><span class=\"vb bad\">Down where it matters</span><span>The pages people can buy from are -25% against a normal Thursday at this hour. Across the site, <b>4,419</b> visits against <b>4,796</b> by this hour on a normal Thursday (-8%).</span></div><div class=\"ttp\"><div class=\"ttph\"><span class=\"ttn\">STD city and state pages</span><span class=\"ttnow\">373</span><span class=\"delta zero\">-13%</span><span class=\"ttvs\">vs 428 on a normal Thursday</span></div><div class=\"ttps\">every /std-testing/ city and state page. Usual swing on a Thursday is \u00b129%.</div><div class=\"chartwrap tt\"><canvas id=\"tt_std_geo_chart\"></canvas></div></div><div class=\"ttp\"><div class=\"ttph\"><span class=\"ttn\">Pages you can buy from</span><span class=\"ttnow\">695</span><span class=\"delta down\">-25%</span><span class=\"ttvs\">vs 926 on a normal Thursday</span></div><div class=\"ttps\">the /tests/ pages with a cart button, plus the eight /std-testing/ product pages (herpes, HIV, panels). Usual swing on a Thursday is \u00b111%.</div><div class=\"chartwrap tt\"><canvas id=\"tt_monetized_chart\"></canvas></div></div><div class=\"ttp\"><div class=\"ttph\"><span class=\"ttn\">Everything else</span><span class=\"ttnow\">3,351</span><span class=\"delta zero\">-3%</span><span class=\"ttvs\">vs 3,442 on a normal Thursday</span></div><div class=\"ttps\">the whole rest of the site. Usual swing on a Thursday is \u00b115%.</div><div class=\"chartwrap tt\"><canvas id=\"tt_other_chart\"></canvas></div></div><p class=\"note\">Engaged visits from Google only, so crawlers and datacenter traffic are out. The cut-off is 18:59 because Analytics keeps adding to recent hours for a while: That hour is the last one whose count stopped changing between two refreshes, and it ended more than 3 hours ago.. Comparing a part-day against finished days would show a fake collapse every morning, so only the same hours are counted on both sides.</p></section>","traffic":{"ready":true,"charts":{"tt_std_geo_chart":{"labels":["12am","1am","2am","3am","4am","5am","6am","7am","8am","9am","10am","11am","12pm","1pm","2pm","3pm","4pm","5pm","6pm"],"today":[21,34,40,55,66,69,83,97,122,151,168,196,217,251,277,305,338,354,373],"base":[18,34,49,63,73,78,86,102,117,146,173,204,238,272,309,341,372,399,428],"day":"Thursday"},"tt_monetized_chart":{"labels":["12am","1am","2am","3am","4am","5am","6am","7am","8am","9am","10am","11am","12pm","1pm","2pm","3pm","4pm